# source: IBM VGA standard 16-colour text mode
# licence: public domain (a hardware standard, no authorship)

000000	Black
0000AA	Blue
00AA00	Green
00AAAA	Cyan
AA0000	Red
AA00AA	Magenta
AA5500	Brown
AAAAAA	Light grey
555555	Dark grey
5555FF	Light blue
55FF55	Light green
55FFFF	Light cyan
FF5555	Light red
FF55FF	Light magenta
FFFF55	Yellow
FFFFFF	White
